      "id": "claim_117a7c40ad8346f59b3acb8700f0954d",
      "statement": "The authoritative runtime is packages/server (@djimitflo/server). It boots from packages/server/src/index.ts, which initializes the SQLite database, runs loop recovery (recoverInterruptedRuns) and task reconciliation (executionEngine.recoverInterruptedTasks), wires services, mounts the API at /api via createRoutes, and attaches an authenticated WebSocket server at /ws that negotiates the bearer.<token> subprotocol.",
